{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/extras/Desccription_main_gif.gif?t=1742411198\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Long ago, little souls lived in harmony in the Forest of Eternal Blossom. One day, everything has changed. The evil bug king attacked the forest and kidnapped all the little souls! Cik, the only survivor of the attack, embarks on a difficult mission to rescue his loved ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve logic puzzles by controlling a little soul. Bloom flowers, gather followers and save your loved one from the Evil Bug King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/extras/BloomFlowers.png?t=1742411198\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bloom flowers to solve logic puzzles. Fly into the flower to bloom it. It will return to its initial state if you fly away. There are many types of flowers that act differently when blossomed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/extras/GatherYourParty.png?t=1742411198\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Most puzzles require other souls to solve them. Rescue them during your journey, they will follow you around and help you with the puzzles. You can order them to fly in the chosen direction or call them back with a single click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some actions require multiple followers to perform. Carefully distribute the followers to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/extras/goBack.gif?t=1742411198\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whenever you wish to restart a puzzle, simply rewind the time and everything will go back to your last checkpoint. Expect a harder puzzle? Make a checkpoint before moving things around to avoid going back. You can have multiple checkpoints, but the number you can make is limited - so checkpoint wisely.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3497510?t=1742411198","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3497510?t=1742411198","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/d82974bc3dd224489a9610fde863a86c6f00826b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742411198","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/d82974bc3dd224489a9610fde863a86c6f00826b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742411198","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/extras/Desccription_main_gif.gif?t=1742411198\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Long ago, little souls lived in harmony in the Forest of Eternal Blossom. One day, everything has changed. The evil bug king attacked the forest and kidnapped all the little souls! Cik, the only survivor of the attack, embarks on a difficult mission to rescue his loved ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve logic puzzles by controlling a little soul. Bloom flowers, gather followers and save your loved one from the Evil Bug King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/extras/BloomFlowers.png?t=1742411198\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bloom flowers to solve logic puzzles. Fly into the flower to bloom it. It will return to its initial state if you fly away. There are many types of flowers that act differently when blossomed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/extras/GatherYourParty.png?t=1742411198\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Most puzzles require other souls to solve them. Rescue them during your journey, they will follow you around and help you with the puzzles. You can order them to fly in the chosen direction or call them back with a single click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some actions require multiple followers to perform. Carefully distribute the followers to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/extras/goBack.gif?t=1742411198\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whenever you wish to restart a puzzle, simply rewind the time and everything will go back to your last checkpoint. Expect a harder puzzle? Make a checkpoint before moving things around to avoid going back. You can have multiple checkpoints, but the number you can make is limited - so checkpoint wisely.</p>","developers":["KBeet Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/header.jpg?t=1742411198","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,